+| ----- | ----------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
+| 1     | `rewrite_set_comparison`                  | Rewrites `ANY` and `ALL` set-comparison subqueries into `EXISTS`-based boolean expressions with correct SQL NULL semantics. |
